{"id":"c889f5ceee2ae9fa","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-minimal-pair.md","title":"0′ 以下的最小对","display":"thm-minimal-pair — 0′ 以下的最小对","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-minimal-pair","aliases":["20-thm-minimal-pair"],"display":"thm-minimal-pair — 0′ 以下的最小对","chapter":"6","section":"6.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 6.2.3；Lemma 6.2.5","source_printed_pages":[135],"source_pdf_pages":[169],"depends_on":["[[20-df-minimal-pair]]","[[20-lem-cross-no-splitting]]","[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-minimal-pair"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-minimal-pair</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-minimal-pair — 0′ 以下的最小对"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 6.2.3；Lemma 6.2.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>135</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>169</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36e73d05a266e3c0\" href=\"?note=36e73d05a266e3c0\" title=\"20-df-minimal-pair\">20-df-minimal-pair</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c64ec89ea811abf4\" href=\"?note=c64ec89ea811abf4\" title=\"20-lem-cross-no-splitting\">20-lem-cross-no-splitting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用有限扩张的 oracle 计算约定。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36e73d05a266e3c0\" href=\"?note=36e73d05a266e3c0\" title=\"20-df-minimal-pair\">20-df-minimal-pair</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c64ec89ea811abf4\" href=\"?note=c64ec89ea811abf4\" title=\"20-lem-cross-no-splitting\">20-lem-cross-no-splitting</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\ [\\operatorname{MinimalPair}(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b)\\land\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf0&#39;\\land\\mathbf b&lt;\\mathbf0&#39;].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\ [\\operatorname{MinimalPair}(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b)\\land\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf0&#39;\\land\\mathbf b&lt;\\mathbf0&#39;].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 交替构造前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\)</span>。逐一对角化所有普通程序，选每列新位，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> 在该位停止则写入不同的布尔值，否则随意补位，保证两列都非可计算。同时遍历所有指标对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i,j)\">\\((i,j)\\)</span>，问是否有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\succeq\\sigma,\\nu\\succeq\\tau,x\">\\(\\rho\\succeq\\sigma,\\nu\\succeq\\tau,x\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_i^\\rho(x)\\downarrow\\ne\\Phi_j^\\nu(x)\\downarrow\">\\(\\Phi_i^\\rho(x)\\downarrow\\ne\\Phi_j^\\nu(x)\\downarrow\\)</span>。有则延伸到这对停止见证；无则保留两个前缀，并由无交叉不同引理保证任何共同全输出可计算。每阶段补位保证两列总定义，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(A,B\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\le_TA,B\">\\(D\\le_TA,B\\)</span>，选各自计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_D\">\\(\\chi_D\\)</span> 的指标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\">\\(i,j\\)</span>。相应不同分支不可能曾被采取，因它会永久导致两个真实输出不同；所以处于无交叉不同分支，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 可计算。两度非零，因此互不可比。若任一等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span>，另一非零度便是共同下度，矛盾；故均严格在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span> 以下。这里用双指标调度直接展开原书的 Posner 简化，结论和构造强度相同。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 6.2.3；Lemma 6.2.5；印刷页 135；PDF 第 169 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-minimal-pair","status":"resolved","id":"36e73d05a266e3c0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-minimal-pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-cross-no-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"c64ec89ea811abf4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-cross-no-splitting]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-minimal-pair","status":"resolved","id":"36e73d05a266e3c0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal-pair]]；see [[20-lem-cross-no-splitting]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-cross-no-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"c64ec89ea811abf4","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal-pair]]；see [[20-lem-cross-no-splitting]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal-pair]]；see [[20-lem-cross-no-splitting]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal-pair]]；see [[20-lem-cross-no-splitting]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal-pair]]；see [[20-lem-cross-no-splitting]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}pair}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\ [\\operatorname{MinimalPair}(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b)\\land\\mathbf a<\\mathbf0'\\land\\mathbf b<\\mathbf0'].","display":true},{"tex":"\\varnothing'","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e","display":false},{"tex":"(i,j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\succeq\\sigma,\\nu\\succeq\\tau,x","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_i^\\rho(x)\\downarrow\\ne\\Phi_j^\\nu(x)\\downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\le_T\\varnothing'","display":false},{"tex":"D\\le_TA,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_D","display":false},{"tex":"i,j","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf0'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf0'","display":false}],"bytes":2159,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["36e73d05a266e3c0","c64ec89ea811abf4","e890b3c29e4a70a3","755e421576224435","dc642dd12c05d028"]}